    "created_at": "2016-08-17T08:55:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-17T08:55:40Z",
    "body": "I guess not throwing is good here. We don't throw when one tries to observe attribute changes using document and subtree: false either, or we don't throw observing childList changes when target is a textnode etc. So there are already many possibly ways to observe something which will never happen.\n",
